      "cooked": "<p>Hello everyone.</p>\n<p>There is this strange price adjustment behavior when you create a PO from a Material Request that has a Sales Order linked to it.</p>\n<p>The new PO items would have their rates automatically updated. When I examine them in the Edit panel , I saw that there are Margin Rate and Discount Amount applied to to the items.<br>\nIt doesn’t happen when I use Get Item From &gt; Material Request, or create directly from Sales Order.</p>\n<p>If it is not a bug is there any ways to disable the pricing changes? Thank you.</p>\n<p>New PO<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/c/cc73514e2497d275c1c2d98df73879126687d305.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/cc73514e2497d275c1c2d98df73879126687d305\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-02-26 164317\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/c/cc73514e2497d275c1c2d98df73879126687d305_2_690x241.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-02-26 164317\" data-base62-sha1=\"taEtbHLBhFgeCs8QZm8Dy4fJy61\" width=\"690\" height=\"241\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/c/cc73514e2497d275c1c2d98df73879126687d305_2_690x241.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/c/cc73514e2497d275c1c2d98df73879126687d305_2_1035x361.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/c/cc73514e2497d275c1c2d98df73879126687d305_2_1380x482.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFBFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2025-02-26 164317</span><span class=\"informations\">1907×667 51.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io